# AGENTS.md

This repository uses KRN Harness.

## KRN Workflow

- Run `krn status` before non-trivial work.
- Run `krn start "<task>"` and `krn context` before edits.
- Read `.krn/current/task-contract.md`.
- Read `.krn/current/context-package.md`.
- Use `.agents/skills/krn-harness/SKILL.md` for the KRN workflow if available.
- Do not edit if KRN reports STOP.
- After edits, run `krn verify` or record why it is not runnable.
- Run `krn handoff`.

`.krn/` may be gitignored, but it is active local runtime state.
